      "doc": "Deliver a self-verified payload to `receiver.on_relay(sender,\\nexecution_id, payload)` without OCR signature verification.\\n\\nThe forwarder does not vouch for the payload; the receiver must verify\\nit. What the forwarder provides is the same replay protection and\\nobservable transmission state that `report()` provides, so a DON can\\ncoordinate a write schedule for payloads that carry their own proof\\n(Streams reports, ZK proofs, ...).\\n\\nSafety properties:\\n- only addresses on the relayer list may call this;\\n- the replay key is derived on-chain from\\n`sha256(receiver \\xe2\\x80\\x96 execution_id \\xe2\\x80\\x96 sha256(payload))`, so a relayer can\\nneither choose the key nor block a different payload;\\n- it dispatches to `on_relay`, never `on_report`, so a receiver that\\ntrusts `on_report` as proof of DON quorum is unreachable from here;\\n- a non-contract receiver is rejected with an error and writes no state.",
      "name": "relay",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "transmitter",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "receiver",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "execution_id",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "payload",
          "type_": "bytes"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "bool",
            "error_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "ForwarderError"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
